        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_LegendEV_07_Boss:LegendEV_07_Boss_004:0115b91c",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_LegendEV_07_Boss:LegendEV_07_Boss_004:0115b91c",
        "jp_sha256": "41d1984097f6359bad81636db1e7d1cb058cd81d823c673cef39960d37371581",
        "official_en_sha256": "a80543816e4567fc47d21e69000b61680678faabd97ca05db70e56be9c9cbd1b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……ですが、かつて英雄と呼ばれた彼は\r\nあなたとの対決を望んでいます。",
        "official_en": "One of these uncanny individuals, a hero no more, requests that you do battle with him.",
        "real_en": "But one who was once called a hero wishes to face you in battle."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
