    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_LegendEV_07_Boss:LegendEV_07_Boss_013:a8c7a333",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_LegendEV_07_Boss",
        "key": "LegendEV_07_Boss_013",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_LegendEV_07_Boss:LegendEV_07_Boss_013:a8c7a333",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_LegendEV_07_Boss:LegendEV_07_Boss_013:a8c7a333",
        "jp_sha256": "9b71f37ad65a396ccf864b4faa64f5394b023d2cf4fe1391b48a783604418cc0",
        "official_en_sha256": "65409f16eff214cbfb277afb0c7bfd046df0cae47c1efedf8c6fa322a824e7bf"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "セフィロスの絶望は深くとも\r\nあなたの想いが、ともにあるなら\r\n希望を拓く力となります。",
        "official_en": "And while the depths of Sephiroth’s despair are indeed abyssal, with you by his side, there may be hope for him yet.",
        "real_en": "Deep as Sephiroth’s despair may be, with your feelings beside him, his power may yet open a path to hope."
      },
      "review": {
