    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_LegendEV_07_Boss:LegendEV_07_Boss_008:3bee4f89",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_LegendEV_07_Boss",
        "key": "LegendEV_07_Boss_008",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_LegendEV_07_Boss:LegendEV_07_Boss_008:3bee4f89",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_LegendEV_07_Boss:LegendEV_07_Boss_008:3bee4f89",
        "jp_sha256": "862db66818a296d5d1256774b5796d93fff3ea9fb101d85228140f555ff30784",
        "official_en_sha256": "df051e8fa4ec611d53726bda996f964041703c73edb24617ee65bf2c839ea45f"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "危ういと悟れば退く、それもまた強さです。\r\nさらなる力を得てから挑んでもよいでしょう。",
        "official_en": "To know when you are overmatched is one type of strength, but please return when you become stronger in the traditional sense.",
        "real_en": "Knowing when to withdraw from danger is another kind of strength. You can challenge him again when you have grown stronger."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
